OL,3,GNEWSAMemories will be lost if orchard
OL,4,Ais axed - girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine-year-old Jasmine has been
OL,7,Fcampaigning to save a community orchard
OL,8,Fthat is under threat from being
OL,9,Fbulldozed.
OL,11,FDeveloper Pearce Construction
OL,12,F(Barnstaple) Ltd has proposed building
OL,13,F160 homes in West Yelland, near
OL,14,FBarnstaple, Devon, including removing
OL,15,Fthe Lagoon View Community Orchard to
OL,16,Fcreate an access route for plant and
OL,17,Fbuilding materials.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
