OL,3,GNEWSAMemories will be lost if orchard
OL,4,Ais axed - girl
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Me and my Green Earth Group, we wrote
OL,7,Fletters to the King, the council, the
OL,8,Fgovernment, we just said how we love
OL,9,Fthis place, how it's just amazing and
OL,10,Fwhy I want it to stay here," said
OL,11,FJasmine, from Fremington.
OL,13,FPearce Construction previously said it
OL,14,Fwould undertake replacement planting,
OL,15,Fcreate a new orchard and improve
OL,16,Fcommunity facilities.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
